WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Read May run out before delivery beneath an item in Ordering or beside its Stock count details.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Check the most recent count and any received stock, then verify pending orders and their arrival dates.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Use Order history to confirm an externally placed order, correct its delivery date or record its receipt.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: If stock is genuinely insufficient, arrange the appropriate supplier action and place an order explicitly.
